@gateway = http://localhost:8090
@keycloak = http://localhost:8092

### OAuth2 token (copy access_token into the variable below)
POST {{keycloak}}/realms/pr8/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=pr8-client&username=student&password=student123

### Paste token
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Products through Traefik and API Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Request-ID: http-client-products

### Create order
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Request-ID: http-client-order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientRequestId": "idea-demo-001",
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2,
  "customerName": "Anna Smirnova",
  "deliveryAddress": "Moscow, Tverskaya street, 10"
}

### Orders
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deliveries created asynchronously
GET {{gateway}}/api/deliveries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SSE timeline
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/1/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### Start delivery
PUT {{gateway}}/api/deliveries/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"IN_TRANSIT"}
